   "options": "<div><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;margin-bottom:10px;\">Please Submit the following documents to R&amp;D Office</strong><ol style=\"list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:outside;margin:0;padding-left:20px;\"><li style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:6px;\">Hard copy of the online TA-DA Settlement application should be submitted with the following documents.</li><li style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:6px;\">Tickets, Boarding passes, where applicable.</li><li style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:6px;\">Proof of payments in all cases.</li><li style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:6px;\">Copy of Participation Certificate in case of Seminar/ Conference etc.</li><li style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:6px;\">All bills should be signed by the claimant.</li><li style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\">Any expenditure in foreign currency should be converted into equivalent Indian Rupees and proof of conversion should be attached.</li></ol></div>"
